000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     SCCLKCHG.
000400 AUTHOR.         J.S.BUNGO.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   9/20/93.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700 INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*D   THIS SUBPROGRAM RENAMES AND DELETES A CORPORATE CODE IN THE MMISA
001000*D   SPARE PARTS LINK DATASET CORP-CODE-LINK.  THIS SUBROUTINE SHOULD BE
001100*D   CALLED WHENEVER A CODE IS RENAMED TO A DIFFERENT CORPORATE CODE,
001200*D   OR WHEN A CORPORATE CODE IS DELETED FROM STORES.  THE PARAMETERS WILL
001300*D   DETERMINE WHICH FUNCTION TO PERFORM ON THE CORP CODE LINK.
      *D   ALSO WHENEVER A LINK IS RENAMED OR DELETED, ANY MACHINE NOTES
      *D   FOR THAT SUBSYSTEM AND PART NUMBER WILL ALSO RENAMED OR
      *D   DELETED.
001400
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CORP-CODE-LINK
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM2102
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT CORP-CODE-LINK2
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM2101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT CC-NOTE-MSTR
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM2201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.
001900
002000 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CORP-CODE-LINK
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CC-LINK-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM2102.
       FD  CORP-CODE-LINK2
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CC-LINK-REC2.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM2101.
       FD  CC-NOTE-MSTR
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CC-NOTE-MSTR-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM2201.

002100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002200
002300 77  FILE-STAT            PIC X(02)  VALUE SPACES.
002700 77  HIER-ARG             PIC X(14)  VALUE SPACES.
002800 77  CC-LINK-EXISTS       PIC X(01)  VALUE "N".
       77  NOTE-EXISTS          PIC X(01)  VALUE "N".
002900
       01  NOTE-ARG.
           05  NOTE-HIER-ARG    PIC X(14)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  NOTE-CODE-ARG    PIC X(08)  VALUE SPACES.

003000 01  CC-LINK-DATA.
003100     COPY DCCLINK IN COPYLIB.
003800
       01  CC-NOTE-DATA.
           COPY MCCNOTE IN COPYLIB.
005500
005600 COPY DBMODES IN COPYLIB.
005700 COPY DBSTAT  IN COPYLIB.
005800
005900 LINKAGE SECTION.
006100 01  OLD-CODE             PIC X(08).
006200 01  NEW-CODE             PIC X(08).
006300 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG       PIC X(60).
006400 01  BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
006500     05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE OCCURS 5 TIMES.
006600         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD  PIC X(14).
006700         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 PIC S9(8).
006800
006900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING OLD-CODE
007100                          NEW-CODE
007200                          BU-DISPLAY-MSG
007300                          BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
007400
           OPEN I-O CORP-CODE-LINK
                    CC-NOTE-MSTR.
           OPEN INPUT CORP-CODE-LINK2.
007500 6-MAIN.
007900     IF NEW-CODE NOT = SPACES
008000*--------RENAME OLD CODE TO NEW CODE
008100         PERFORM RENAME-CODE THRU RENAME-CODE-EXIT
008200     ELSE
008300*--------OLD CODE IS BEING DELETED
008400         PERFORM DELETE-CODE THRU DELETE-CODE-EXIT
008500     END-IF.
           CLOSE CORP-CODE-LINK
                 CC-NOTE-MSTR
                 CORP-CODE-LINK2.
009300     GOBACK.
009400
009500 RENAME-CODE.
           MOVE OLD-CODE TO CCLINK OF CORP-CODE-LINK.
           START CORP-CODE-LINK KEY = CCLINK OF CORP-CODE-LINK
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
009800     IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
010600         GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT.
010700 RENAME-LOOP.
           READ CORP-CODE-LINK NEXT INTO CC-LINK-DATA
               AT END MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
011000     IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
011100         GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
011200     ELSE IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
011300         MOVE "READ ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, RENAME"
011400              TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
011500         MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
011600         MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
011700         MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
011800         GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT.
           IF CC-LINK NOT = OLD-CODE
               GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT.
           DELETE CORP-CODE-LINK
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
012000     IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
012100         MOVE "DELETE ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, RENAME"
012200              TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
012300         MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
012400         MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
012500         MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
012600         MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
012700         GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT.

      *----REMOVE ANY MACHINE NOTES TO BE REPLACED
           MOVE HIER-KEY TO HIER-ARG.
           MOVE "N" TO NOTE-EXISTS.
           MOVE HIER-ARG TO NOTE-HIER-ARG.
           MOVE OLD-CODE TO NOTE-CODE-ARG.
           MOVE NOTE-ARG TO NOTEKEY OF CC-NOTE-MSTR.
           READ CC-NOTE-MSTR INTO CC-NOTE-DATA
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "23"
              IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
                  MOVE "READ CC-NOTE-MASTER ERROR, RENAME"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                  MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                  MOVE NOTE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                  MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                  GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
              ELSE
                  MOVE "Y" TO NOTE-EXISTS
                  DELETE CC-NOTE-MSTR
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
                  END-DELETE
                  IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
                      MOVE "DELETE CC-NOTE-MASTER ERROR, RENAME"
                          TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                      MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                      MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                      MOVE NOTE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                      MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                      GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
                  END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

012800*----IF NEW CC-LINK EXISTS ALREADY FOR SUBSYSTEM THEN DO NOT RE-ADD
012900     MOVE "N" TO CC-LINK-EXISTS.
013100     PERFORM CHECK-NEW-CC-LINK THRU CHECK-NEW-CC-LINK-EXIT.
013200     IF CC-LINK-EXISTS = "Y"
013300         GO TO RENAME-CODE.

           MOVE CC-LINK-REC TO CC-LINK-DATA.
013400     MOVE NEW-CODE TO CC-LINK.
           WRITE CC-LINK-REC FROM CC-LINK-DATA
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
014600     IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
014700         MOVE "WRITE ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, RENAME"
014800              TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014900         MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
015000         MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
015100         MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
015200         MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
015300         GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT.

           IF NOTE-EXISTS = "Y"
               MOVE NEW-CODE TO NOTE-CODE-ARG
               MOVE NOTE-ARG TO NOTE-KEY
               WRITE CC-NOTE-MSTR-REC FROM CC-NOTE-DATA
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
014700             MOVE "WRITE ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, RENAME"
014800                  TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014900             MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
015000             MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
015100             MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
015200             MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
015300             GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
               END-IF
           END-IF.
016300     GO TO RENAME-CODE.
016400 RENAME-CODE-EXIT.
016500     EXIT.
016600
016700 DELETE-CODE.
           MOVE OLD-CODE TO CCLINK OF CORP-CODE-LINK.
           START CORP-CODE-LINK KEY = CCLINK OF CORP-CODE-LINK
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
017000     IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
017800         GO TO DELETE-CODE-EXIT.
017900 DELETE-LOOP.
           READ CORP-CODE-LINK NEXT INTO CC-LINK-DATA
               AT END MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
018200     IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
018300         GO TO DELETE-CODE-EXIT
018400     ELSE IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
018500         MOVE "READ ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, DELETE-CODE"
018600            TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
018700         MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
018800         MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
018900         MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
019000         GO TO DELETE-CODE-EXIT.
           IF CC-LINK NOT = OLD-CODE
               GO TO DELETE-CODE-EXIT.
           DELETE CORP-CODE-LINK
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
019200     IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
019300         MOVE "DELETE ERROR CORP-CODE-LINK, DELETE-CODE"
019400              TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019500         MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
019600         MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
019700         MOVE OLD-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
019800         MOVE HIER-KEY TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
019900         GO TO DELETE-CODE-EXIT.
      *----REMOVE ANY MACHINE NOTES
           MOVE HIER-KEY TO NOTE-HIER-ARG.
           MOVE OLD-CODE TO NOTE-CODE-ARG.
           MOVE NOTE-ARG TO NOTEKEY OF CC-NOTE-MSTR.
           READ CC-NOTE-MSTR INTO CC-NOTE-DATA
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "23"
              IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
                  MOVE "READ CC-NOTE-MASTER ERROR, DELETE"
                      TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                  MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                  MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                  MOVE NOTE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                  MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                  GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
              ELSE
                  DELETE CC-NOTE-MSTR
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT
                  END-DELETE
                  IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
                      MOVE "DELETE CC-NOTE-MASTER ERROR, DELETE"
                          TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                      MOVE "SCCLKCHG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                      MOVE FILE-STAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                      MOVE NOTE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                      MOVE NEW-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                      GO TO RENAME-CODE-EXIT
                  END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.
020000     GO TO DELETE-CODE.
020100 DELETE-CODE-EXIT.
020200     EXIT.
020300
020400 CHECK-NEW-CC-LINK.
           MOVE HIER-ARG TO HIERKEY OF CORP-CODE-LINK2.
           START CORP-CODE-LINK2 KEY = HIERKEY OF CORP-CODE-LINK2
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
020700 CHECK-CC-LINK-LOOP.
020800     IF FILE-STAT = "00"
               READ CORP-CODE-LINK2 NEXT INTO CC-LINK-DATA
                   AT END MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
021100         IF FILE-STAT = "00"
                   IF HIER-KEY = HIER-ARG
021200                 IF CC-LINK = NEW-CODE
021300                     MOVE "Y" TO CC-LINK-EXISTS
021400                 ELSE
021500                     GO TO CHECK-CC-LINK-LOOP
                   ELSE
                       MOVE "10" TO FILE-STAT.
021600 CHECK-NEW-CC-LINK-EXIT.
021700     EXIT.
